Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 00:08:33 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] d3d10umd: DirectCompute 4.x - CreateComputeShader (TGSI->NIR
 CSO), CsSet*, buffer UAVs, raw/structured SRVs, Dispatch(Indirect), UAV
 clears; CS4x cap on (exynos-woa 0114)

---
